er system configuration.\n                \n\n                &lt;h4&gt;What\u2019s New in DriverMax 16:&lt;\/h4&gt;\n\n\n\nImproved, brand new interface\nIncreased interface responsiveness\nIncreased interface responsiveness\nSimplified design allowing even beginner users to update their drivers\nImproved backup and restore options with a lot of additional safety features\nNo installation wizard, no fuss; all installations are fully automatic\nKeeps all PC drivers up-to-date\nIdentifies unknown hardware and installs the appropriate drivers\nAllows users to backup all system drivers and restore them after reinstalling Windows\nImproved driver detection and installation algorithm\nA broad range of license types tailored for all user needs: 30 days, 1 year, 2 years and Lifetime\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Homepage \u2013 &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/secure.avangate.com\/affiliate.php?ACCOUNT=INNOVAAL&amp;AFFILIATE=22107&amp;PATH=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.drivermax.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener sponsored\"&gt;https:\/\/www.drivermax.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSupported Operating Systems: Windows XP, Vista, 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11 (32-bit, 64-bit).\n\nDriverMax 12 - How To Update Your DriversWatch this video on YouTube\n\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Size: 64.4 MB\n\n\nDOWNLOAD DriverMax\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n        &lt;\/div&gt;\n\nSOURCE_URL: unknown\n\nPHP_DETECTED_METADATA (Weak Hints):\n{\"software_name\":\"DriverMax\",\"version\":\"18.0.298\",\"homepage\":\"\",\"category\":\"\",\"is_existing_article\":true,\"detected_version\":\"\",\"detected_file_size\":\"64.4 MB\",\"resolved_links\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/api.drivermax.com\\\/download\\\/DriverMax-Setup-18.0.298.msi\",\"normalized_url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/api.drivermax.com\\\/download\\\/DriverMax-Setup-18.0.298.msi\",\"text\":\"DOWNLOAD DriverMax\",\"context\":\"DOWNLOAD DriverMax\",\"source\":\"anchor\",\"source_host\":\"api.drivermax.com\",\"platform\":\"Windows\",\"variant\