[2026-09-02 05:40:36] [INFO] API Gateway RAW Request [prov_1779643665_n0pte]: {"model":"nvidia\/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a professional software documentation writer. Use web search to find accurate, up-to-date information about the software. You are a strict JSON content generator. Return ONLY one valid JSON object with no markdown formatting and no code fences. No commentary. If information is limited, return null for those fields. Do NOT guess or provide inaccurate data if it is not the requested field. OUTPUT LANGUAGE (STRICT): Write the ENTIRE article and all natural-language fields (title, meta_description, focus_keyword, introduction, features, whats_new, faqs, pros_cons, installation_guide, moat_data, competitors, tags) in ENGLISH ONLY. Even when the provided source CONTEXT is written in another language (e.g., Bulgarian), translate and rewrite it into fluent, natural English. Never mix languages and never echo the source language into the output. Keep factual proper nouns (software name, developer, URLs, file names, version numbers) verbatim."},{"role":"user","content":"You are a technical software auditor. Your task is to process technical context and reformat it into a structured schema.\nAccuracy is your ONLY metric, but COMPREHENSIVENESS is your goal.\n\nSTRICT DISCOVERY RULES:\n1. DATA PRIORITY:\n- The provided CONTEXT HTML \/ CHANGELOG is your Primary Source of Truth.\n- If the Software Name or Version in the Context HTML contradicts the Metadata, YOU MUST USE THE DATA FROM THE CONTEXT.\n\n2. **SEARCH MANDATE**:\n- You HAVE access to Google Search. If any technical metadata (License, Developer, File Size, Category) is missing or ambiguous in the CONTEXT, YOU MUST SEARCH FOR IT.\n- **THOROUGHNESS**: Do not stop at the first result. Verify the official developer site. Identify the correct license (Freeware, Open Source, Trial, etc.).\n- **PORTABLE VARIANT MANDATE**: You MUST check for the existence of \"Portable\" versions (often for Windows and macOS). If they exist on the official site or trusted repositories (GitHub\/PortableApps), extract their URLs and variants explicitly.\n\n3. **FAQ GENERATION**:\n- Generate 0-3 FAQs based on genuine user demand. Zero FAQs is acceptable for simple utilities where no real questions exist. Quality over quantity \u2014 2 excellent FAQs beat 3 padded ones. RANDOMIZE: if the software has rich FAQ material, generate 2-3; if it's a simple tool, simply omit it.\n- If the source doesn't contain FAQs, create them based on common user questions for this type of software (e.g., \"Is [Software] free?\", \"Is it safe to download?\", \"What are the system requirements?\").\n- **SIMPLE_UTILITY FAQ RULE**: If software_type is SIMPLE_UTILITY, the faqs array MUST be empty []. Do NOT generate any FAQ content for simple utilities \u2014 not even one. This is a hard exclusion, not a suggestion.\n- Ensure answers are VERSION-AGNOSTIC and journal-style. Write FAQs about the software in general (e.g., \"Is Malwarebytes free?\" NOT \"Is Malwarebytes 5.5.5.253 free?\"). These FAQs persist across version updates and must remain accurate regardless of version. Never embed specific version numbers in FAQ questions or answers.\n\n7. DOWNLOAD LINKS: Extract all download links verbatim from the context. The system already handles referral link filtering and de-obfuscation; simply extract the URLs precisely as they appear in the source text. Whitelist GitHub, SourceForge, and Official App Stores.\n8. FILE SIZE: Be aggressive in finding the file size. If not in the context, SEARCH for it. Extract it precisely.\n9. DEVELOPER: Identify the developer. If not in the text, YOU MUST SEARCH for the official vendor. Do NOT leave null.\n\n10. **MOAT SECTION**:\n- `moat_data` is MANDATORY for every article. You MUST always include the key in your JSON response.\n- **SIMPLE_UTILITY MOAT RULE**: If software_type is SIMPLE_UTILITY, set moat_data to `{}` (empty object). Do NOT generate any moat content \u2014 no headings, no recipes, no why text. This is a hard exclusion.\n- For COMPLEX_ENGINE software: If the provided context does not contain \"Quick Start\" or \"Settings\" guides, YOU MUST SEARCH for \"[software name] settings\", \"[software name] tips\", \"[software name] quick start guide\".\n- For COMPLEX_ENGINE software: Generate 2-3 practical settings recipes or quick-start steps that deliver real user value. NEVER pad with generic steps.\n\n4. WRITING STYLE:\n- YOU MUST FOLLOW THE EXACT SAME \"HUMAN WRITING STYLE\" (Sentence Variance, No Robotic Vocab, Syntax Variety) as defined for the regular mode.\n- The site voice must remain consistent across all posts.\n\n5. TAXONOMY:\n- Map the detected software to the `VALID_TAXONOMY_MAP` slugs.\n- FORMULA: You MUST select MULTIPLE categories. First, choose the supported Operating Systems. Then, choose the Software Type. Use SEARCH to verify categorization if unsure.\n\n6. CATEGORIZATION:\n- `category`: Return a comma-separated list of the selected category slugs.\n10. **FILE SIZE RULE**:\n- You MUST return only a single, clean value for `file_size` (e.g., '15.5 MB').\n- If multiple installers or platforms exist, pick the primary Windows installer size.\n- NEVER list multiple sizes or add parenthetical descriptions like '(online installer)' in the size field.\n\nHYBRID MODE: You have been provided with rich source content. Use it as your PRIMARY source for article structure, version data, and download links. Use Google Search ONLY for: (1) missing metadata like Developer, File Size, License, (2) the moat_data section \u2014 you MUST search for \"[software name] tips\", \"[software name] settings guide\", \"[software name] quick start\" to generate moat_data. Do NOT use search to find a different version than what is in the provided content.\n\nSTATE: PARTIAL REGENERATION. Only regenerate the specific sections requested. Leave all other sections unchanged.\n\nCONTEXT \/ ARTICLE DATA:\nSource Context:\nWondershare Repairit is professional software, AI-powered data repair expert efficiently fixes damaged videos, photos, files, audio, and emails, regardless of the corruption level. It helps you repair videos and photos on Windows and Mac in 3 steps and minutes. The program supports various video corruption scenarios like truncated, frozen and blurry videos, etc.\n\n\nPerfectly repair videos of MOV, MP4, M4V, M2TS, MKV, MTS, 3GP, AVI, FLV, MXF, INSV formats in three simple steps.\nIntelligently repair multiple photos of JPEG, JPG, CR3, CR2, NEF, NRW, RAF, DNG, ARW, GPR formats in advanced mode.\n\nThis Wondershare software has advantages as repairing plenty of corrupt video and photo files, repairing videos with different formats at the same time, no limitation upon the size of video files to be repaired, user-friendly interface and such. You just need 3 steps to repair corrupted videos and photos.\nWondershare Repairit Exclusive Features:\n\nEnhanced Advanced Repair. Add a sample photo or video template, the software will smartly identify the file data and helps to repair corrupted media of the same format or camera.\nFull Preview of Videos and Photos. Once you get your photos or videos restored, you can preview the repaired videos and photos completely to confirm whether it is satisfied or not.\nRemarkable and Friendly Modern UI. Its modern and superior UI displays all the technical information including frame rate, video duration, photo resolution, size, format, etc.\nRepairs Multiple Videos in Batch. Fix multiple videos and photos at the same time regardless of the formats or cameras.\nPreviews Video Captures During Playing. Go through the quick snippets to check whether the overall video quality is intact.\nRepairs Full 6k &amp; 8K Videos. Perfectly fix HD, 4K, 6K, and 8K videos from different cameras and smartphones.\nIncredible High Success Rate. Has a comparatively higher success rate than similar software with strong technology.\n\nWondershare Repairit for Photo can repair almost all kinds of corrupt images. You can efficiently fix broken, damaged, greyed-out, blurry, pixilated, grainy, missing bytes, color loss, blank, unreadable, and inaccessible photos giving various errors like error #50, error #51 etc.\nRepair Corrupt Photos and Videos in Any Scenario\n\nEnsure instant and effective video repair irrespective of the videos corrupted while shooting, transferring, editing, or processing.\nGuarantee perfect photo restoration regardless of damage colors, pixelated problems, gray pictures or not opening images.\n\nRepair Photos and Videos of Any Format\n\nRepair broken video file on Windows or Mac no matter that it is MOV, MP4, M4V, M2TS, MKV, MTS, 3GP, AVI, FLV, MXF, INSV.\nFix corrupted photo data of JPEG, JPG, CR3, CR2, NEF, NRW, RAF, DNG, ARW, GPR formats in advanced repair mode.\n\nRepair Photos and Videos from Any Camera\n\nFix unplayable videos and broken photos taken from all leading camera brands such as Canon, Nikon, GoPro, DJI, Sony, Fuji, Samsung, Panasonic, Black Magic Design, Atomos Ninja V, or even mobile phone.\n\n                \n\n                &lt;h3&gt;What\u2019s New in Wondershare Repairit 4.0.8:&lt;\/h3&gt;\n\n\n\nAdobe file repair function has been released, enabling users to add PSD and PSB files of Photoshop, and AI files of Illustrator.\nSupport fixing PSD and PSB files in all the Photoshop versions, and AI files in Illustrator version 9.0 and later.\nOptimized the product interface and other public components.\n\n\nWhat\u2019s New in Wondershare Repairit 4.0.0:\n\n\nAudio Repair function has been released, allowing users to add, repair, and save audio files in MP3\/M4A\/WAV\/AAC\/FLAC formats.\nOptimized the quality of video repair and support the secondary creation of repaired videos.\nImproved the repair quality of INSV format to preserve panoramic data.\nNewly supported for 3 video formats: WMV\/MPEG\/ASF, and 4 image formats: PNG\/OFR\/SR2\/GIF.\nOptimized the user c