\u0441rop tool is now faster and adjusts both your video and project aspect ratio in one pass. Quickly transform horizontal clips into Reels, Shorts, vlog teasers, and more, all while automatically keeping the main subject perfectly in frame \u2013 whether it\u2019s a person, a product, or your beloved pet.\n\n\nWhat\u2019s New in version 26.15.0 (2026-05-12):\n\n\nTry active word highlighting in your subtitles \u2013 that karaoke-style effect you\u2019ve probably seen in popular creator videos. The tool automatically highlights each spoken word, making your videos way easier to follow and giving them that stylish blogger vibe everyone loves.\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Homepage \u2013 &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/secure.avangate.com\/affiliate.php?ACCOUNT=MOVAVI&amp;AFFILIATE=22107&amp;PATH=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.movavi.com%2Fvideo-editor-plus%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener sponsored\"&gt;https:\/\/www.movavi.com\/video-editor-plus\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSystem Requirements:\n\n\nmacOS 11.0 or higher,\nWindows 10, 11 with up-to-date patches and service packs installed\nProcessor: Intel, AMD, or compatible dual-core processor, 1.5 GHz\n\nIntel HD Graphics 2000, NVIDIA GeForce series 8 and 8M, Quadro FX 4800, Quadro FX 5600, AMD Radeon R600, Mobility Radeon HD 4330, Mobility FirePro series, Radeon R5 M230 or higher graphics card with up-to-date drivers\n\nDisplay: 1280 \u00d7 768 screen resolution, 32-bit color\n\n\nEN - Movavi Video Editor 2023 | Make videos. Create. Inspire.Watch this video on YouTube\n\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Size: 2.73 MB\n\n\nDOWNLOAD Movavi Video Editor Plus Trial for Windows\n\nDOWNLOAD Movavi Video Editor Plus Trial for macOS\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n        &lt;\/div&gt;\n\nSOURCE_URL: unknown\n\nPHP_DETECTED_METADATA (Weak Hints):\n{\"software_name\":\"Movavi Video Editor Plus\",\"version\":\"26.23.1\",\"homepage\":\"\",\"category\":\"\",\"is_existing_article\":true,\"detected_version\":\"26.23.