mized for Windows 10 (32 and 64-bit).\n\n\n\nLicense: Completely free for personal and commercial use.\n\n\nConclusion\n\nIf you value your privacy and want Windows 10 to work by your rules, O&amp;O ShutUp10 is a must-have tool in your software arsenal. It is fast, secure and extremely effective. License: Freeware.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOfficial page | ChangesDownload: O&amp;O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 32-bit (71.0 MB)Download: O&amp;O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 64-bit (76.2 MB)Download: O&amp;O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows ARM (72.6 MB)\n\nSOURCE_URL: unknown\n\nPHP_DETECTED_METADATA (Weak Hints):\n{\"software_name\":\"O&amp;O ShutUp10++\",\"version\":\"3.5.1130\",\"homepage\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.oo-software.com\\\/en\\\/shutup10\",\"category\":\"\",\"is_existing_article\":true,\"detected_version\":\"3.5.1130\",\"detected_file_size\":\"71.0 MB\",\"resolved_links\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.com\\\/files\\\/ooshutup10\\\/OOSU10-x86.exe\",\"text\":\"O&O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 32-bit\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.com\\\/files\\\/ooshutup10\\\/OOSU10.exe\",\"text\":\"O&O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 64-bit\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.com\\\/files\\\/ooshutup10\\\/OOSU10-arm64.exe\",\"text\":\"O&O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows ARM\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"}],\"detected_links\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.com\\\/files\\\/ooshutup10\\\/OOSU10-x86.exe\",\"text\":\"O&O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 32-bit\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.com\\\/files\\\/ooshutup10\\\/OOSU10.exe\",\"text\":\"O&O ShutUp10 3.5.1130 for Windows 64-bit\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/dl5.oo-software.