[2026-09-02 15:34:02] [INFO] API Gateway RAW Response [prov_1779643665_n0pte]: {"id":"gen-1788363220-Nfn4L5PW3PBBPHmvccdC","object":"chat.completion","created":1788363220,"model":"minimax/minimax-m3:free","provider":"GMICloud","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"stop","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"title\":\"WACUP 1.99.54.24960 Preview Download for Windows (Preview Build)\",\"meta_description\":\"Download WACUP free for Windows to enjoy a modernized Winamp experience with 64-bit support, updated codecs, and classic skin compatibility. Lightweight and freeware.\",\"slug\":\"wacup\",\"focus_keyword\":\"WACUP\",\"long_tail_keywords\":[\"WACUP Windows 11 64-bit preview\",\"WACUP offline installer preview build\",\"WACUP 1.99.54.24960 preview 2026\"],\"needs_manual_input\":[\"tech_specs.homepage\",\"system_requirements.minimum.os\"],\"keyword_variations\":[\"download WACUP\",\"get WACUP\",\"WACUP installer\",\"WACUP for Windows\"],\"introduction\":[\"WACUP (WinAmp Community Update Project) is a community-driven continuation of the legendary Winamp media player, rebuilt for modern Windows systems. It preserves the classic Winamp interface, skins, and plug-ins while introducing native 64-bit support, modern codec libraries, and numerous stability fixes that the original Winamp never received.\",\"For anyone who still misses the simplicity, customization, and lightweight footprint of the Winamp era, **WACUP** delivers that same experience with a much more modern backbone under the hood.\"],\"tech_specs\":{\"software_name\":\"WACUP (WinAmp Community Update Project)\",\"file_name\":\"WACUP_Preview_v1_99_54_24960_x64.exe\",\"version\":\"1.99.54.24960 Preview\",\"license\":\"Free\",\"developer\":\"WACUP Team (WinAmp Community Update Project)\",\"homepage\":\"https://getwacup.com/\",\"changelogurl\":\"https://getwacup.com/previewbuild/\",\"file_size\":\"9.7 MB\",\"os_support\":\"Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, Windows 10, Windows 11 (32-bit and 64-bit)\",\"language_support\":\"English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, and others\",\"last_updated\":\"Preview Build\"},\"features\":[{\"name\":\"Modernized Winamp Core\",\"description\":\"**WACUP** rebuilds the classic Winamp 5.666 core engine with hundreds of bug fixes, native 64-bit compatibility, and improved memory handling, delivering a faster and more stable experience than legacy Winamp builds without changing the familiar look and feel.\"},{\"name\":\"Native 64-bit Support\",\"description\":\"Unlike the original Winamp which was 32-bit only, **WACUP** ships dedicated 64-bit builds that allow the player to take advantage of more system memory and avoid common 32-bit compatibility issues on modern Windows installations.\"},{\"name\":\"Updated Multimedia Libraries\",\"description\":\"The preview bundles updated versions of LAME 4.0, libfaad2 2.11.3, Monkey's Audio 13.25, mpg123 1.33.7, OpenSSL 3.5.8, cppwinrt 3.0.260818.1, and vgmstream for improved playback of MP3, MP4, FLAC, OGG, APE, and game audio formats.\"},{\"name\":\"Classic Skin Compatibility\",\"description\":\"**WACUP** retains full support for the classic Winamp classic skins as well as modern Winamp Modern skins, so users can continue using thousands of existing skin files and plug-ins without modification.\"},{\"name\":\"Improved Playlist Management\",\"description\":\"A new Advanced preference lets playlists saved by **WACUP**'s core use either relative paths (the default) or absolute file paths, improving compatibility with other programs that consume playlist files such as DJ tools and media managers.\"},{\"name\":\"Expanded Format Support\",\"description\":\"**WACUP** can now make an initial attempt to handle fragmented MP4 files directly, avoiding the need to rebuild the MP4 container with external tools, and offers improved FLAC streaming support for both Ogg+FLAC and raw FLAC streams.\"},{\"name\":\"Lightweight Performance\",\"description\":\"Designed as a focused alternative to bloated modern media suites, **WACUP** maintains the famously low resource footprint of the original Winamp while adding contemporary features and regular community-driven updates.\"},{\"name\":\"Dual Big Clock Plug-in\",\"description\":\"The Big Clock plug-in can now be duplicated as gen_bigclock2.dll, allowing users to display two clock windows simultaneously, such as one showing elapsed time and another showing remaining playlist time.\"}],\"whats_new\":[\"More flexible playlist paths with an Advanced preference for relative or absolute path saving, improving compatibility with external playlist consumers.\",\"Improved fragmented MP4 support allowing direct playback without rebuilding the container with external tools.\",\"Better slow-connection handling via adjusted network timeouts and libcurl connection setup for very slow links.\",\"Improved FLAC streaming support covering both standard Ogg+FLAC streams and raw FLAC content setups.\",\"Smarter lyrics and metadata lookup with reordered lyrics sources and improved handling of untagged files.\",\"Faster Big Clock plug-in using a faster API for playlist elapsed and remaining time, avoiding slow local-library database access.\",\"Dual Big Clock windows now supported via gen_bigclock2.dll for displaying two simultaneous clock views.\",\"Updated bundled libraries including LAME 4.0, libfaad2 2.11.3, Monkey's Audio 13.25, mpg123 1.33.7, OpenSSL 3.5.8, cppwinrt 3.0.260818.1, and vgmstream.\"],\"system_requirements\":{\"minimum\":{\"os\":\"Windows 7 or later (32-bit or 64-bit)\",\"processor\":null,\"ram\":null,\"disk_space\":null,\"graphics\":null},\"recommended\":{\"os\":\"Windows 10 or later (64-bit)\",\"processor\":null,\"ram\":null,\"disk_space\":null},\"_note\":\"Detailed CPU, RAM, and disk requirements are not officially published; only supported Windows versions are documented.\"},\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"Is WACUP free to download?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, WACUP is distributed as freeware. The preview builds can be downloaded for free from the official getwacup.com website without any subscription or purchase requirement.\"},{\"question\":\"Does WACUP work on 64-bit Windows?\",\"answer\":\"WACUP ships dedicated 64-bit builds alongside 32-bit installers, so it runs natively on both 32-bit and 64-bit editions of Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, and 11.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use my old Winamp skins and plug-ins with WACUP?\",\"answer\":\"WACUP retains full compatibility with classic Winamp skins and most legacy plug-ins, so existing user-created skins and third-party plug-ins generally continue to work without modification.\"}],\"installation_guide\":{\"steps\":[\"Step 1: Click the download button above to get the WACUP installer matching your Windows architecture (32-bit or 64-bit).\",\"Step 2: Locate the downloaded WACUP_Preview executable in your Downloads folder and double-click it to launch the installer.\",\"Step 3: Follow the on-screen installation wizard, choose your install location, and complete the setup to start using WACUP.\"],\"compatibility_notes\":\"Compatible with Windows 7 and later, including Windows 8, 8.1, 10, and 11 in both 32-bit and 64-bit editions.\",\"common_issues\":[\"Issue: Installer reports a missing component → Solution: Install the latest Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable from the official Microsoft site.\",\"Issue: Old Winamp plug-ins fail to load → Solution: Check the WACUP plug-in compatibility list on getwacup.com before reinstalling legacy plug-ins.\",\"Issue: Skins appear distorted on high-DPI displays → Solution: Enable DPI compatibility mode from the WACUP preferences or switch to a modern skin.\"]},\"tags\":[\"wacup\",\"freeware\",\"mediaplayer\"],\"_tags_note\":\"3 tags covering the software identity, license type, and software subtype. Single-token tags only, no version numbers or generic filler.\",\"software_type\":\"COMPLEX_ENGINE\",\"moat_data\":{\"_note\":\"Generated for COMPLEX_ENGINE classification. WACUP is a richly configurable media player with extensive plug-in support, skinning, and preferences.\",\"content\":[{\"heading\":\"Enable 64-bit Build for Better Stability\",\"recipe\":\"1. Download the WACUP x64 preview installer from the official site\\n2. Install it into a separate folder from any existing 32-bit WACUP or Winamp install\\n3. Launch the 64-bit build and import your existing settings via Preferences > General > Import Winamp/WACUP settings\\n4. Verify all installed plug-ins load under the 64-bit process before daily use\",\"why\":\"Running the 64-bit build removes the 32-bit memory ceiling, reduces crashes when handling large playlists, and allows modern plug-ins that target 64-bit Windows to load without compatibility shims.\"},{\"heading\":\"Configure Big Clock for Dual Display\",\"recipe\":\"1. Locate your WACUP plug-ins folder (usually inside the install directory under Plugins)\\n2. Copy gen_bigclock.dll and rename the copy to gen_bigclock2.dll\\n3. Launch WACUP and open both plug-ins from the plug-in selection menu\\n4. Set one instance to show elapsed time and the other to show remaining time using each window's display options\",\"why\":\"This setup is popular among DJs, streamers, and radio hosts who need both elapsed and remaining time visible at a glance without switching windows.\"},{\"heading\":\"Switch Playlist Path Mode for External Tools\",\"recipe\":\"1. Open WACUP and go to Preferences > Playback > Advanced\\n2. Locate the new playlist saving path mode option (relative or absolute)\\n3. Choose Absolute if you sync playlists with external DJ software, media managers, or portable devices\\n4. Save preferences and re-save an existing playlist to confirm the new path format\",\"why\":\"Relative paths keep playlists portable across drives, but absolute paths are often required when third-party tools index or relocate th