\nSource Context:\nAshampoo Photo Commander 27 Pro is versatile photo software for viewing, managing, editing, and presenting images. The program combines photo management, image editing, presentation, and creative output in a clearly structured Windows application.\nPhotos can be conveniently browsed, sorted, rated, optimized, and prepared for different purposes. Features include batch processing, duplicate search, slideshows, collages, greeting cards, printing functions, metadata support, and tools for everyday work with large photo collections. The Ashampoo product\u2019s new version focuses especially on helping users find important photos faster.\nAshampoo Photo Commander 27 \u2013 Only $50 \nAutomatic portrait detection filters selfies, portraits, couple shots, and group photos with a single click. The analysis runs in the background, takes place entirely locally on the PC, and requires neither cloud access nor an internet connection. This keeps images on the user\u2019s own computer while making suitable people photos easier to find.\nThe browser has also been improved: The duplicate filter works faster with large collections, thumbnails are processed more efficiently, and the redesigned Classic Miniatures style presents names, dates, file sizes, and orientation more clearly. The Save As dialog has also been modernized and now offers clear presets for JPEG XL, WebP, and JPG. JPEG XL is loaded and saved natively, while AVIF is loaded natively, each including metadata.\nAshampoo Photo Commander 27 Features:\n\nAutomatic portrait detection for selfies, portraits, couple shots, and group photos\nFully local analysis without cloud access, uploads, or an internet connection\nWork locally with private images, no hidden cloud uploads\nNon-disruptive background image analysis\nFaster duplicate filter for large image collections with many thousands of files\nRedesigned classic miniature view with enhanced visibility of name, date, size, and orientation\nUp to 50% faster thumbnail generation with lossless compression\nNew Save As dialog with presets for JPEG XL, WEBP, and JPG\nNative JPEG XL support: load and save + metadata\nNative AVIF support for loading, including metadata and animations, no external codec required\nSupport for ultra-large image files, including PSB, BigTIF, and gigapixel formats\nImproved format support for RAW, TIF, JPEG 2000, JPG, SVG, and APCDOC\nModernized interface with more consistent dialogs and better support for dark designs\n\nFind duplicates, edit metadata, smart-search for files\nNo more duplicate photos \u2013 with four-way fingerprint technology\nAshampoo Photo Commander 27 is handy indeed! It scans your library for duplicates and helps you filter your photos by name, EXIF\/IPTC data, or comments. Looking for a needle in a haystack has just become super-easy. You can even add missing metadata manually so you\u2019ll never lose track of your photos again!\nCollages, cards and frames included\nFrom birthdays to Christmas: Create just the right card in no time\nGet creative: Ashampoo Photo Commander 27 lets you create stylish collages and elegant cards with the help of numerous included templates. Add nifty frames to your photos and combine images and texts to create greeting cards for holidays, parties, and special occasions.\n                \n\n                &lt;h3&gt;New Highlights und Features:&lt;\/h3&gt;\n\n\n\nAutomatic portrait detection for selfies, portraits, couple shots, and group photos\nFully local analysis without cloud access, uploads, or an internet connection\nWork locally with private images, no hidden cloud uploads\nNon-disruptive background image analysis\nFaster duplicate filter for large image collections with many thousands of files\nRedesigned classic miniature view with enhanced visibility of name, date, size, and orientation\nUp to 50% faster thumbnail generation with lossless compression\nNew Save As dialog with presets for JPEG XL, WEBP, and JPG\nNative JPEG XL suppo